\newlabel{tab:policies}{{III}{6}{One realisation, Kraichnan $\xi =2$, $256^2$, $\chi =16$, after one time unit: $L_2$ error and variance of the TT relative to its dense twin. With the variance budget alone the mean drifted by $4\times 10^{-4}$ (hybrid) and $2\times 10^{-2}$ (standard) of the field's standard deviation; with the adopted rule the drift is $10^{-16}$}{table.3}{}}
